# the same-samples check (tools/same_samples.py): the Drones pages after PLAY stops them. Drones 1's curves dim with
# the fade and settle on one thin gray line, as at power-up (Evan, 2026-11-10: they had stayed lit); Drones 2's
# waves the same. Then Shimmer switched off (it washes out over 6 s) and on again: it starts clean, not with its last audio. Not a test of
# its own (no expectations).
notips
wav stop.wav
wait 300
shot powerup.png
tap PLAY
wait 2500
shot playing.png
tap PLAY
wait 400
shot fading.png
wait 3000
shot stopped.png
page 1
wait 300
shot stopped-2.png
page 0
set 64 4
set 63 80
tap PLAY
wait 6000
set 64 0
wait 7000
set 64 4
wait 3000
